%% Source: docs-src/observability.md

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Caller A
    participant B as Caller B
    participant T as AniLink transport
    participant P as Provider token endpoint

    A->>T: request with stale token
    T->>P: call forwarded
    P-->>T: 401 Unauthorized
    T->>T: open one in-flight refresh grant
    B->>T: request (also 401)
    T->>T: join the existing grant
    T->>P: refresh grant
    alt grant succeeds
        P-->>T: new access token
        T->>T: onTokenRefresh (once per grant)
        T->>P: replay each request once
        P-->>T: 200 OK
        T-->>A: response
        T-->>B: response
    else grant fails
        P-->>T: grant rejected
        T->>T: onTokenRefreshError (once per grant)
        T-->>A: rejects with sanitized AniLinkError
        T-->>B: same error
    end
